                <pb facs="0146" n="34" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg34"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referred to the chief of the chemical section for his information, as he should
                    have for an antecedent the date sent by this division to the department of
                    animal industry relative to the systems employed in the analysis of animal
                    products.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Fynn.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
